<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech real Aug construct output rises 7.2pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech real Aug construct output rises 7.2pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction output in the Czech Republic rose 7.2 percent in August in real terms compared with the same month in 1995, the Czech Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>CONSTRUCTION OUTPUT   AUG/96   JULY/96  AUG/95   JAN-AUG/96</p>
<p>  real pct chg yr/yr   +7.2    +17.0    +13.9	  +5.8</p>
<p>avg nominal monthly</p>
<p>   wages chg yr/yr    +12.1    +18.9    +16.0	 +15.4</p>
<p>Note: Output figures are based on all sizes of companies.</p>
<p>Wage figures are calculated only on the basis of companies with 25 or more employees.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
